@WalrusProtocol  is a decentralized storage and DA protocol aimed at blockchain applications and agents.
The mainnet of Walrus entered Epoch 1 in March 2025 and operates with 100+ storage nodes; it also opened up mechanisms for publishing/retrieving blobs, Walrus Sites (hosted websites), and staking with the mainnet WAL to determine subsequent committees, etc. This means $WAL 
The core demand for AL comes from three aspects: paying for storage fees, staking to participate in security and node selection, and rewards distributed around services and block generation cycles, while this economic activity is 'locked' in Sui's contract system. This clearly shows the role of the native token.
